    "detailed_description": "Mirai Minato, a student at Mokuyo High School, is enjoying his ordinary days spent with his tsundere childhood friend, Meguri Sasaduka. She dutifully performs the childhood friend trope of waking him up in the morning by climbing in through his window\u2015<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/ecbf832600a15cba820f083133ba7dc7.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br>M-Meguri? How do you know what I\u2019m writing? Actually, that's not important right now. I\u2019m trying to set the scene and entice the reader with the setting of the game. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/85650529ac00fde1aca9012e91976e4e.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br>Anyway, as we were saying\u2026 Mirai\u2019s ordinary days come to a halt as he gets hit with meet cute after meet cute and he suddenly finds all kinds of romantic routes opening up before him! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/ac7a3b12602170b0772a449fcdfac035.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br>Guh, Mei, please not right now, the person reading this might buy the game you\u2019re in. I'm doing my best to write an enticing description here!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/4c6ba8e2a9ff1744588c05b904acd9ed.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br><i>*ahem*</i> As Mei said, there are plenty of characters and routes to check out, so it will be up to you to make sure Mirai makes the right (or wrong) choices to navigate the often unpredictable routes to romance! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/806e6e45e55ad7f85506416bda31851f.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br>Huh, Rumi? You\u2019re acting kind of strange, is everything ok? I was about to close out the description with a killer line about \u201cfinding love beyond the fourth wall\u201d or something, has the twinkle in your eye fallen out again? Sorry, I have to take care of this really quick\u2026<br>\u2026<br>\u2026<br>\u2026<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/d775bd5ccb0217a891b5e40face266b6.poster.avif?t=1708094233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/d775bd5ccb0217a891b5e40face266b6.webm?t=1708094233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/d775bd5ccb0217a891b5e40face266b6.mp4?t=1708094233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Hey! Rumi! I found it just down here!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/b137ac06d42feb8f6331a50dc8dfc800.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br>\u2026 Nobody else is going to pop up? We\u2019re almost done right? <i>*Phew*</i> I can finally finish this thi\u2015<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/c53e8e8ddf10e87661571c104ff1ff19.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br>GAH\u2015 WHAT IS A HAWK DOING HERE?! THERE ARE 3 MAIN ROUTES TO COMPLETE, WITH 20 SUB-ROUTES TO FIND AND\u2015<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1739160/extras/6aad6f2ce7357d28bbd3dbaf19f76943.avif?t=1708094233\" /></div><br> J-JUST PLEASE BUY THE GAME ALREADY!",
